        "hypothesis": "The binding file is missing but the CUDA kernels contain a bug. The conv_transpose1d kernel uses an incorrect condition for valid input positions: it checks `il % stride == 0`, but should check `(ol + padding - k) % stride == 0` while also ensuring the resulting index is valid. This causes wrong contributions for some output positions, leading to sign mismatches.",
