- **NO third-party libraries**: Except cuBLAS (GEMM only) and cuDNN (Conv only)
- **NO modifications to utils/ directory**
- **NO modifications to binding.cpp or binding_registry.h**: These are fixed infrastructure

### ✅ ALLOWED ONLY
